    "rich_text_qE7BaU": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_d6rwjz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>The Problem</em></p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-sm",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "marker",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_iJ7P7D": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Something is happening to your face. And you can't figure out what it is.</strong>",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle",
            "highlighted_reveal": false
          }
        },
        "text_g7DibU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You look in the mirror and something is off. You can't quite name it, but your face doesn't look the way it used to.</p><p>Your jawline isn't as sharp. There's puffiness under your eyes that doesn't go away no matter how much water you drink or how much sleep you get. Your face looks heavier, softer — like it's slowly sliding downward. Maybe one side looks slightly different than the other. People guess you're older than you are. You look tired even when you're not.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_d6rwjz",
        "heading_iJ7P7D",
        "text_g7DibU"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.name",
      "settings": {
