    "rich_text_rfRz7b": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_A79XgU": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em>Introducing</em></p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "marker",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_tHrBHP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "QuestProps — The Posture Release Tool for Your Face",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle",
            "highlighted_reveal": false
          }
        },
        "image_pPR6Xk": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/e3eb20618715a00161459b119272ce4f.jpg",
            "image_width": "full_width",
            "image_max_width": 50,
            "image_max_width_mobile": 50
          }
        },
        "text_hFLbCR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>QuestProps was designed to target the exact area where forward head posture originates — the back of the neck, where the SCM and deep cervical muscles lock up. It's not a general-purpose massager. It's a precision release tool built for one job: undoing the postural tension that's pulling your face down.</p>",
            "text_font": "heading",
            "text_size": "subtext-lg",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_p6Vykd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>✦<strong>16 kneading nodes</strong> that physically work into locked SCM and deep neck muscles — not vibration, mechanical release</p><p>✦<strong>42°C sustained heat</strong> that penetrates deep muscle tissue to release chronic tension the nodes can't reach alone</p><p>✦<strong>10 minutes per session</strong> — used on the back of the neck before bed or in the morning</p><p>✦<strong>Targets the source</strong> — releases the SCM to take tension off the platysma, opens drainage pathways<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-sm",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "image_hh7niz": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/3f53024023752c07e6fb47e94f18dcdf.jpg",
            "image_width": "full_width",
            "image_max_width": 50,
            "image_max_width_mobile": 50
          }
        },
        "text_3ijdxT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Four kneading nodes target the locked SCM directly. 42°C heat penetrates deep tissue. The chain reverses.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-sm",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_fFFFTd": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When the SCM releases, the head moves back over the shoulders. Tension comes off the platysma. The drainage pathways in your neck decompress. And your face returns to its natural position — the one that's been hidden under years of postural tension.</p><p><strong>This isn't skincare. It's structural. Fix the neck, and the face fixes itself.</strong></p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "button_NGPqnj": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Release the Tension - See Your Real Face",
            "button_link": "shopify://products/neck-massager",
